' purpose: bounded offline ordinary per-object fixture custody, without Native authority
' covers: tooling/native-ingress/custody.mjs
' covers: tooling/native-ingress/custody.test.mjs
' context: _spec/_plans/ml-runtime-redesign.md section 12 records the implementation unit.
' scope: standalone ordinary helper; no F9 private initializer or standard-slot ABI.
' validation: parent owns syntax checks, PlantUML checkonly/render and test execution.
@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title Ordinary per-object custody — bounded offline fixture

participant "tooling/native-ingress/\ncustody.test.mjs" as TEST <<app>>
participant "tooling/native-ingress/\ncustody.mjs" as SOURCE <<app>>
participant "node:fs / process\nhost runtime" as HOST <<host>>
database "rootPath\nfresh directory" as ROOT <<db>>
database "fixture.bin\nfresh regular file" as FILE <<db>>
participant "CustodyError" as ERROR <<error>>

TEST ARROW_MAIN SOURCE : stageFixture(rootPath, {bytes, expectedSha256})
SOURCE ARROW_MAIN SOURCE : start 3.5s cooperative deadline; validate input
SOURCE ARROW_MAIN SOURCE : copy Buffer; verify incoming SHA-256
note right of SOURCE
Absolute normalized non-root path
Buffer length 1..65536; lowercase SHA-256
Intrinsic typed-array length
Bounded native byte copy
end note

group Fresh root; no collision repair
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN HOST : check platform flags; capture effective UID once
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN HOST : mkdirSync(rootPath, 0700, recursive:false)
  HOST ARROW_MAIN ROOT : exclusive directory creation
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN HOST : open root: RDONLY | DIRECTORY | NOFOLLOW | NONBLOCK
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN HOST : fstat + lstat, bigint:true
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN SOURCE : assertRoot(named, opened, uid); retain rootBirth
end
note over SOURCE, ROOT
Root security: dev, ino, mode, uid, gid, nlink
Directory, effective UID, exact mode0700
Root binding excludes size and timestamps
end note

group Exclusive file birth and one write
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN HOST : open fixture: WRONLY | CREAT | EXCL | NOFOLLOW | NONBLOCK
  HOST ARROW_MAIN FILE : create fixture.bin with mode0600
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN HOST : fstat + lstat, bigint:true
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN SOURCE : assertFileBirth(named, opened, uid)
  note over SOURCE, FILE
Regular file, effective UID, exact mode0600
nlink1; birth size0; named/FD snapshot equal
  end note
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN HOST : one writeSync, position0, full input length
  HOST ARROW_MAIN FILE : write copied bytes
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN SOURCE : require full count; no short-write retry
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN HOST : fstat + lstat file; fstat + lstat root
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN SOURCE : assertFilePhase; birth security unchanged; rootBinding
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN HOST : close writer before reader acquisition
end

note over SOURCE, FILE
Content: dev, ino, mode, uid, gid, nlink,
size, mtimeNs, ctimeNs — all bigint
Security fields and size fit unsigned 64-bit
Full equality within each file phase
Birth-to-written comparison: security only
end note
note over ROOT, FILE
Each object retains its own device identity
because parent and file devices may differ.
Stable host paths remain required; checks cannot
protect ancestors against concurrent change.
end note

group Independent readback after writer closure
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN HOST : open fixture: RDONLY | NOFOLLOW | NONBLOCK
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN HOST : fstat + lstat, bigint:true
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN SOURCE : assertFilePhase; full snapshot equals written
  loop Exact positional chunks, at most 4096 bytes each
    SOURCE ARROW_MAIN HOST : readSync at current offset; require exact count
    HOST ARROW_MAIN FILE : read fixture bytes
    SOURCE ARROW_MAIN SOURCE : update independent SHA-256; advance offset
  end
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN HOST : one-byte EOF probe at expected length
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN SOURCE : require EOF and expected readback SHA-256
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN HOST : fstat + lstat file, bigint:true
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN SOURCE : assertFilePhase; full snapshot still equals written
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN HOST : close reader; fstat + lstat root
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN SOURCE : rootBinding; prepare frozen DATA_ONLY result
end

group Failure handling and unconditional descriptor finalization
  opt Any guard, I/O or explicit close fails
    SOURCE ARROW_ERROR ERROR : preserve CustodyError; normalize other failures to E_FS
  end
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN HOST : finally: close remaining file/root holders once
  note over SOURCE, HOST
Clear holder before each close attempt
Closures bypass deadline and operation guards
At most three total close attempts
  end note
  opt Any close attempt fails
    SOURCE ARROW_ERROR ERROR : E_CLOSE takes priority; no uncertain-close retry
  end
end
note over SOURCE, ERROR
Close uncertainty prevents a success result
because descriptor disposition is no longer known.
The helper retains partial roots for inspection;
only the test removes its fresh owned paths.
end note

alt Failure recorded
  SOURCE ARROW_ERROR TEST : throw failure; no result
else All checks and closes succeeded
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN SOURCE : final cooperative deadline guard
  SOURCE ARROW_MAIN TEST : frozen ordinary-per-object-v1 / DATA_ONLY
end
note right of TEST
nativeAuthority:false; installed:false
Point-time byte verification, not immutability
end note
note over SOURCE, HOST
96 ordinary-operation cap; max two owned FDs
Max fixture: one write, 17 reads, three opens
Cooperative clock, not an OS blocking-I/O bound
end note
@enduml
